    "progressSummary": "COMPLETE: ℚ-algebra isomorphism algebraicNumbersField ≃ₐ[ℚ] AlgebraicClosure ℚ (verified, 0-axiom); #(AlgebraicClosure ℚ)=ℵ₀, Countable+Infinite transported across it.",
